-<section class="section company-layer" id="recruiter"><div class="shell"><div class="layer-heading"><span>01 · RECRUITER</span><h2>What matters to this operating environment.</h2></div><div class="company-two-col"><article class="card"><h3>Alignment thesis</h3><p>Strategic innovation-expansion target. A testable GlacierEQ bottleneck hypothesis exists, but no company-specific accomplishment, affiliation, proprietary access, or employer-confirmed internal condition is claimed.</p><p>No company-specific repository is currently admitted to the public recruiter surface. Transferable personal flagships may still be relevant, but they are not company adoption evidence.</p></article><article class="card boundary-card"><h3>Truth boundary</h3><p>Independent GlacierEQ work; no affiliation, endorsement, employment, proprietary access, or production deployment with the named target is claimed.</p><p><strong>Current public claim ceiling:</strong> company_alignment_only</p></article></div></div></section>
