-<section class="section company-layer" id="recruiter"><div class="shell"><div class="layer-heading"><span>01 · RECRUITER</span><h2>What matters to this operating environment.</h2></div><div class="company-two-col"><article class="card"><h3>Alignment thesis</h3><p>Strategic innovation-expansion target. A testable GlacierEQ bottleneck hypothesis exists, but no company-specific accomplishment, affiliation, proprietary access, or employer-confirmed internal condition is claimed.</p><p>No company-specific repository is currently admitted to the public recruiter surface. Transferable personal flagships may still be relevant, but they are not company adoption evidence.</p></article><article class="card boundary-card"><h3>Truth boundary</h3><p>Independent GlacierEQ work; no affiliation, endorsement, employment, proprietary access, or production deployment with the named target is claimed.</p><p><strong>Current public claim ceiling:</strong> company_alignment_only</p></article></div></div></section>
-<section class="section alt company-layer" id="master"><div class="shell"><div class="layer-heading"><span>02 · MASTER</span><h2>Innovation, architecture, and the governed second-depth gate.</h2></div><div class="company-two-col"><article class="card"><h3>Role-specific engineering frame</h3><p>The current dossier identifies the domain and public evidence subset without pretending that company-level bottlenecks have already been proven. Second depth advances only through pinned public evidence: role → externally supportable problem → inspected repository → bounded remedy → implementation receipt → reproduced proof → promoted claim.</p><h3>Current repository evidence</h3><p class="empty-state">No direct repository is recruiter-admitted yet. This is an engineering queue, not a reason to invent proof.</p></article><article class="card aspiration-card"><p class="eyebrow">SECOND-DEPTH STATE</p><h3>Mapped Only</h3><p><strong>Claim ceiling:</strong> company_alignment_only</p><h3>Blocking conditions</h3><ul class="evolution-list"><li>current_role_not_verified</li><li>company_problem_not_bounded</li><li>repository_code_not_inspected</li><li>proof_not_reproduced</li></ul><p><strong>Next gate:</strong> Verify a current public role or operating context before making any company-specific problem or implementation claim.</p></article></div></div></section>
-<section class="section company-layer" id="machine"><div class="shell"><div class="layer-heading"><span>03 · MACHINE</span><h2>Dense integration contract.</h2></div><div class="card machine-contract"><div class="machine-contract-head"><p>Compact wire view for agents and tooling. The structured record carries the same second-depth state and public-safe evidence references.</p><a class="button ghost small" href="record.json">record.json</a></div><pre>GEQ.CI/1 id=shield_ai state=scaffold track=CANDIDATE_TARGET_REQUIRES_DIRECT_EVIDENCE
-ROLE[Applied AI Systems Engineer|Agent Infrastructure Engineer|Forward-Deployed Engineer|Platform / Reliability Engineer]
-REPO[∅]
-FLAGSHIP[∅]
-DEPTH[MAPPED_ONLY|company_alignment_only]
-BLOCKER[current_role_not_verified|company_problem_not_bounded|repository_code_not_inspected|proof_not_reproduced]
-HOOK route=/companies/shield-ai/ json=/companies/shield-ai/record.json
-NEXT Verify a current public role or operating context before making any company-specific problem or implementation claim.</pre><p class="machine-hook">Consumer path: discover route → inspect record → follow pinned public evidence → verify native receipts/tests → respect stage prerequisites, blockers, claim ceiling, and non-affiliation boundary.</p></div></div></section>
-<section class="section alt company-layer" id="mesh"><div class="shell"><div class="layer-heading"><span>04 · MESH</span><h2>One node in the larger GlacierEQ system.</h2></div><div class="company-two-col"><article class="card"><h3>Relationships</h3><p class="empty-state">No direct public repository edge is admitted yet.</p><p><a href="/mesh/">Open the estate-wide Mesh →</a></p><h3>Current blockers</h3><ul class="evolution-list"><li>current_role_not_verified</li><li>company_problem_not_bounded</li><li>repository_code_not_inspected</li><li>proof_not_reproduced</li></ul></article><article class="card evolution-card"><p class="eyebrow">ASPIRATION &amp; EVOLUTION</p><h3>Governed promotion path</h3><ol class="evolution-list"><li><strong>CURRENT</strong> Mapped Only<br><small>company_alignment_only</small></li><li><strong>□</strong> Role Verified<br><small>verified_role_alignment</small></li><li><strong>□</strong> Problem Bounded<br><small>externally_bounded_problem_alignment</small></li><li><strong>□</strong> Code Inspected<br><small>inspected_implementation_alignment</small></li><li><strong>□</strong> Remedy Bounded<br><small>bounded_remedy_design</small></li><li><strong>□</strong> Implemented<br><small>implemented_candidate_capability</small></li><li><strong>□</strong> Proof Reproduced<br><small>reproducible_company_specific_proof</small></li><li><strong>□</strong> Claim Promoted<br><small>proof_bound_company_specific</small></li></ol><p><strong>Current stage:</strong> MAPPED_ONLY</p><p><strong>Next gate:</strong> Verify a current public role or operating context before making any company-specific problem or implementation claim.</p><p>The path does not advance because a company name, repository, or aspiration exists. It advances only when the upstream Helix state carries the required pinned public evidence.</p></article></div></div></section>
